// # Every enum in the system, grouped by domain, in the same order as   #
// # the model sections above. Grouping enums here (instead of next to   #
// # whichever model happened to need one first) makes every status/     #
// # type vocabulary in the platform visible in one place — useful when  #
// # checking "does an equivalent enum already exist before adding a     #
// # new one" or auditing for the kind of silent duplication/naming      #
// # drift this consolidation exists to fix (see docs/data/data-model.md #
// # for the full inventory of what was already found and merged here).  #
